            "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:32:27.52402+00:00",
            "notes": "Always choose  [Out with a Bang](item_0c3398a1-34aa-48d0-81c1-0e4f1cf4f739) first! If you're able to shoot the dynamite mid-air, you're guaranteed to keep them burning for a while. Not only that, but the dynamite CD starts as soon as you throw the dynamite, which means the additional 3 sticky dynamites will go off during that cooldown.\n\nIt's good to spec into AP early, but for the first two rounds I would definitely focus on some survivability items. Choose  [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) if you feel you're going to die a lot.",
