            "notes": "Sell everything you can and buy  [Stacked Sticks](item_2ad5dace-ac3c-43fe-b20b-3add489a7207)!! This will make it a whole lot easier to hit multiple targets with just one dynamite.\n\nIf you have over $14,000, sell  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and buy either  [Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e) or  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016), depending on how much survivability you need.\n\nIf you have less than $14,000 but a bit more than $12,000, just spec into more AP greens or survivability greens - your choice!",
