            "notes": "Now THIS is where the build starts to get good. Choose  [B.O.B Jr.](item_a0599423-2cd6-4779-81c1-fb933fbad07d) as your second power and let Baby Bawb do the work for you!!! Play your cards right, he'll be a 6th player on your team for the majority of the round. If they have flankers that are harassing you however, maybe opt for  [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) first.\n\nYou should start focusing on building your ability power; the more burning you apply to the enemy team, the quicker you will get Baby Bob. Aim for items that add to building ult charge, such as  [Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e), and preferably   [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) and  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) to boost your AP up to 45%. If there is a Kiriko, make sure you choose  [Furnace Fuel](item_aac67acc-e7d0-4465-b3d3-1276a6de0f86) instead of one of the two above!! \n\nIf you're a little bit short on cash, feel free to buy any other AP epic item that you feel best suits your playstyle/game situation.",
