            "notes": "For your third power, choose  [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df). Chances are your targets will already be burning due to your first power and the larger explosion radius, so this power is GREAT. Just contributes to more ult farming. If you chose this power in Round 3, now is the time to pick  [B.O.B Jr.](item_a0599423-2cd6-4779-81c1-fb933fbad07d) :)\n\nChoose  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) for healing reduction or  [Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262) if you prefer to shoot them while burning and your aim is good. You can even sell  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) for one of these if you prefer and have extra cash.",
